{"type":"standard","title":"Gabe Evans","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Gabe Evans</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q115458993","titles":{"canonical":"Gabe_Evans","normalized":"Gabe Evans","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Gabe Evans</span></span>"},"pageid":72348764,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Rep._Gabe_Evans_official_photo%2C_119th_Congress.jpg/330px-Rep._Gabe_Evans_official_photo%2C_119th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/Rep._Gabe_Evans_official_photo%2C_119th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1000,"height":1250},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1382087985","tid":"73759122-d14c-11f1-a456-0fd96c2153d7","timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:49:31Z","description":"American politician (born 1986)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gabe_Evans","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gabe_Evans?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gabe_Evans?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Gabe_Evans"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gabe_Evans","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Gabe_Evans","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gabe_Evans?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Gabe_Evans"}},"extract":"Timothy Gabriel Joseph Evans is an American politician, former law enforcement officer, and former U.S. Army officer serving as the U.S. representative for Colorado's 8th congressional district since 2025. A member of the Republican Party, Evans was previously a member of the Colorado House of Representatives from 2023 to 2025.","extract_html":"<p><b>Timothy Gabriel Joseph Evans</b> is an American politician, former law enforcement officer, and former U.S. Army officer serving as the U.S. representative for Colorado's 8th congressional district since 2025. A member of the Republican Party, Evans was previously a member of the Colorado House of Representatives from 2023 to 2025.</p>"}